{
  "comment": [
    "Error codes for the projects / sessions / memory / corpus domain.",
    "",
    "Schema, loader and the tests that lock this file are documented in",
    "00-foundation.json — read that first. One file per domain so a",
    "conversion pass never serializes behind a single editor.",
    "",
    "Domain notes that a translator needs and the schema cannot carry:",
    "",
    "  - `path` is always the raw filesystem path, exactly as the user's",
    "    machine spells it: `/Users/me/proj`, `C:\\Users\\me\\proj`,",
    "    `\\\\server\\share\\proj`. It is never normalized, re-separatored",
    "    or shortened on its way into params (rules/paths.md), so a",
    "    localized sentence must place it verbatim.",
    "  - `detail` is always English — an underlying io/sqlite/serde",
    "    complaint. A localized sentence appends it; it never gets",
    "    translated.",
    "  - Several English messages name a CLI flag or argument the GUI",
    "    has no equivalent for (`--pattern`, `--secrets`, `--all`,",
    "    `force_sync_conflict`, `force_live_session`, `GITHUB_TOKEN`).",
    "    Those strings are frozen — the CLI prints them verbatim — and",
    "    the code carries the session id or path instead so the GUI",
    "    sentence can name the thing and offer a button.",
    "  - `MigrateError::Project` has no code of its own: the variant is",
    "    `#[error(\"{0}\")]`, so it delegates to the wrapped",
    "    `ProjectError`'s code and params rather than freezing an",
    "    English clause inside a localized sentence.",
    "  - `crate::trash` (single transcripts) and `project::trash` (whole",
    "    project artifact directories) are separate enums with separate",
    "    codes on purpose. Same shapes, different objects.",
    "  - `project.dry_run_superseded` is NOT a failure and its message is",
    "    NOT prose. `__claudepot_dry_run_superseded__` is a protocol",
    "    sentinel the renderer substring-matches to discard a stale",
    "    rename preview. Translate the catalog sentence if you like — it",
    "    is never shown — but the `message` on the wire must stay that",
    "    exact string."
  ],
